        },
        {
          "text": "Abalo ba-Amoni bakaletela Uziya mu telo nkabela impuwo yakwe yakasika mane kumanjililo aa-Egepita, nkaambo wakaba muyumu loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
