          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Uziya kajisi impi iyakali kucita inkondo. Basilumamba nibakali kwiinka kukulwa bakali muzipanzi zyabo mbubakabikwa kumaanza aa-Jeueli mulembi a-Maaseya silutwe a-Hananiya, bapati bamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweelwe woonse wabapati banzubo babasilumamba wakasika kuzyuulu zyobile amyanda iili musanu aumwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumaanza aabo kabajisi makamu makamu aabasilumamba, zyuulu zili myanda yotatwe amusanu azibili amyanda yosanwe. Aba bakakonzya kulwisya canguzu kukugwasya mwami kuzunda basinkondonyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino basilumamba boonse Uziya wakababambila zikwabilizyo amasumo ankowani azibaki zyakulwisya amata amabwe aakuwaala ankwilipo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu-Jerusalemu wakapanga zintu nzibakayeeyede bantu bacenjede, nzyaakabika azisanza azyooko, zyakakonzya kufusa mivwi amabwe mapati. Nkabela impuwo yakwe yakaya koonse koonse, nkaambo wakagwasigwa cakugambya mane lumwi wakayuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
